            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CarolynCooks"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So very good. I used dried garlic instead and it was still fantastic. Adding wine and cheese was a great idea. Worth the time it took to make it. Added some marjoram. Will make again soon!",
            "datePublished": "2016-01-08T13:14:22.900Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I upped the serving amount to six and I threw in more minced garlic and one minced sweet onion. I also used brown sugar instead of white. After taste testing it, I added additional oregano and basil. I used this in Pepperoni Pizza Bake. One of the best pizza sauces I've found on this site, with adjustments. The longer it simmers, the better it gets.",
            "datePublished": "2011-08-29T14:24:14.563Z"
          },
